WEBVTT

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.100
Creed Diskenth!

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.770
As the captain of the
Chronos Numbers, I shall...

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.500
eliminate you!

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.710
Creed, prepare to die!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:19.330
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:38.720
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:45.060
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:51.400
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:57.740
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:04.240
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:10.250
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.750
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:23.750
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.340
"Cat Faces a Showdown"

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.590
Useless! It's useless!

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.730
There!

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:05.670
What!?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.600
I thought I said it's useless.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:16.410
Now then, stay still and let me kill her...

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:25.250
The female sweeper who put this
horrible scar on my face... Saya Minatsuki!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.760
Saya, he said!?

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:33.100
Die, Saya Minatsuki!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.770
Hold it! She's not Saya!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.430
It's useless, Sven.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.770
He can't hear you at all.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.000
Well, we have no choice
but to run for now!

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.410
Not bad...

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.420
But I want more...

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.080
I want a fierce melody.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.760
More fierce...

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:34.850
and more sensual melody...

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.780
It's a pretty nice tune...

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:54.440
That amazing determination
and fighting sprit...

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.180
Or rather, is this pleasant feeling
"murderous intent"?

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.740
Arks Sword style,
the 36th Finishing Stroke...

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.070
"Death World"!

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:28.080
Before the Wisdom King,
become ash without pain and suffering,
(<i>Wisdom King = statue behind the piano</i>)

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.740
Creed Diskenth!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.480
Th- this is!?

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:50.770
It is finally complete... my ultimate power!

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.770
Ultimate power?

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:57.110
No matter how critical the injury is,
I am able to heal myself instantly...

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:59.440
I can also live eternally.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.070
I have indeed become a "god".

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.390
Where are you!?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.620
Where are you, Saya Minatsuki!?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.660
Come on out!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.740
There you are!!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.400
Rot, Saya Minatsuki!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.210
Huh!?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.010
Why you! What're you trying to do!?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:45.420
Your shirt stayed on you
even though you dissolve anything...

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:51.760
In other words, this shirt
shouldn't rot and fall, right?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.250
Strike the gong, Eve.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.100
Come then!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.600
Vision Eye... on!

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.710
Too bad.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:14.380
After all, it seems the symphony can't be
finished with you as an opponent, Sephiria.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:18.620
This "Song of Murderous Intent
and Friendship"

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:22.390
requires harmony with my true partner...

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.730
with Train Heartnet, that is...

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.730
Heartnet!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:34.740
Yes! Train is the one with whom I can
change this world into "paradise",

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:40.410
and who is suitable to reign together
with me as a god!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:43.850
The paradise... you desire...

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:51.420
It's different from the
false peace under Chronos' rule.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:56.430
Train and I will choose
who deserves to live,

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.430
and the rest of the trash
will be eliminated.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:02.370
It will be a peaceful paradise
filled with murderous intent.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.700
Ridiculous!

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:06.700
Such a ridiculous dream...

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.760
I cannot let it become...

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:13.570
reality!!

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.710
Yes, I know...

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:18.410
Train!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.410
I have to eliminate this obstructive melody
before you come, right!?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.730
The fate of those who defy God...

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.740
How pitiful...

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:45.410
Farewell, Sephiria Arks.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.970
Rest in peace.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.850
For heaven's sake!

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:11.200
It seems "The Song of Murderous Intent
and Friendship" will be unfinished...

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.910
I've come... to bring you bad luck!

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:34.060
Train...

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:37.730
No, Black Cat...

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:43.070
You are the one and only man I respected.

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:47.070
That's why... that's why I cannot accept it!

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:51.410
That the only way to release you
from the hold of that witch...

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:54.040
is to kill you!!

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:59.750
I don't think of you as Train any longer!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.510
I will kill you without fail!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:16.430
<i>It's useless Preta Ghoul.</i>

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:21.740
<i>My Vision Eye can clearly see</i>
<i>your next one hundred punches!</i>

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.790
It's useless!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:44.690
This sword is... a part of me!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:18.130
Of all things... that witch's trick...

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:30.040
You should know that you can't
bring me down with an attack like that

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:33.910
since I've become a god...

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:51.460
See? Good as new already.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.460
What'll you do?

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:57.570
The way I am now,
you can shoot through my head,

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:01.160
but as long as there's one fragment
of my brain left, I can regenerate.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:06.410
Use that!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.410
Sephiria!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.080
Your Hades...

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:20.090
can demonstrate its ultimate power
only by using that "orichalcum bullet".

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.430
No matter what your target is,

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:28.330
it will be able to instantly destroy
the target down to the molecular structure.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.100
Sorry, Sephiria.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:39.110
I didn't come here to kill Creed.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:42.780
I came to take him
into custody as a sweeper!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.780
Oh stop!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.780
I've had enough!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.450
Now that the song ended unfinished...

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.960
I wanted this painting at least,

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:58.160
to be finished by dyeing these eyes
crimson with your blood,

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.360
no, with your blood and mine!

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:08.530
But with the way you are now,
red just doesn't suit the image I have.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:13.080
Because when one loses
his murderous intent,

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.940
the beautiful red isn't suitable.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.420
And!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:22.850
All that was needed
to complete this statue

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.550
was to carve your murderous look
on those eyes!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:33.090
But now, I don't even know
which way to turn those eyes.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.320
What!?

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.980
Heartnet!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.760
Shoot, Heartnet!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.660
Fire that orichalcum bullet!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:49.110
Since this sword is part of you...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:54.200
if I break it apart, your heart
will be destroyed, too!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:15:01.480
Break apart!!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:14.060
Too bad...

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.100
The disappointment and anger over you

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:19.070
felt by my Imagine Blade
makes its strength so great...

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:21.940
that not even your
orichalcum bullet can destroy it.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:26.840
Oh?

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:31.750
I see...

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.750
So that's the orichalcum bullet.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.420
Fine...

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.650
Go ahead and shoot
through my head with that bullet.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.690
You may be able to defeat me.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:49.430
Don't make me repeat it!

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:52.440
It'd be meaningless if I killed you.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:57.110
You have to live and start over.

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.440
To make up for all those you've killed.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.710
And, of course, for Saya too.

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:08.670
And like me... Saya is probably
wishing the same thing.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.650
That witch again!

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:21.400
Damned witch! That witch!

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.800
That witch! That Damned witch!!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:32.130
Dammit!

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.750
I feel so sad, Train.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.090
I wanted to create it with you...

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:45.320
the eternal paradise.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.800
Saya!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:09.710
Damn you, what nerve...

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.410
You damn witch!!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.820
Train-<i>kun</i>... the way sweepers do things...

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:22.730
Let's show it to him...

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:26.030
Shatter into pieces!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.090
Why aren't you killing me?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.080
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:57.890
We're sweepers, that's why.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.030
Next!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.700
No one's left.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:05.370
Huh!?

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.370
He cleaned up most of them.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.710
Well, I just did it
to take my mind off things.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:15.370
Ha! Show off!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.710
You people are...

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:25.320
It's over, everyone.

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:31.390
Yes, the battle is over.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:34.060
Sephiria-<i>san</i> or Creed...

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:36.260
It's over no matter who won...

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.230
Heartnet...

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.410
Why?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:47.240
That's the way of a sweeper.

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:29.050
<i>Let's sing the song</i>

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:36.390
<i>Let's sing the world's song</i>

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:43.730
<i>how far shall we go</i>

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:50.740
<i>Looking up in the sky</i>

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:57.080
<i>A baby's first cry</i>

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.080
Echidna...
<i>A baby's first cry</i>

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:58.810
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>
Echidna...

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.080
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.080
Can you do it, Eve?
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.450
Uh-huh...
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.420
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:06.760
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.760
Wh- what're you going to do!?
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:12.760
The nanomachines for immortality
inside your body...
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:14.100
<i>Carrying our feelings</i>
The nanomachines for immortality
inside your body...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:19.100
I think they can be destroyed
if I send my nanomachines into your body.
<i>Carrying our feelings</i>

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.770
N- no!

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.440
Stop!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:25.770
I was finally able to
attain the power of a god!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.110
I don't want to become a mortal again!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:32.110
I'd rather die by your hands, Train!

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.780
Can't do that.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:38.120
Live like a human,
bearing the burdens of mortal life...

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:43.130
in this world, which you say
is rotten to the core.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.790
Live as a human being.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.560
No!!

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.710
You really sure about this?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.750
Do whatever you like...

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.540
Just take care of that fool.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:12.420
Why didn't you stop them for me?

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:19.760
To tell you the truth, I've always
wanted you to stay just a human.

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:24.560
Because I was afraid
you'd go beyond my reach.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.770
Let's go somewhere far and rest.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:33.040
It's going to be all right.
I'll protect you.

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:40.780
Making him atone for his sins
with life rather than death.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:45.480
That was your answer that you
came to, wasn't it, Heartnet?

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:55.800
What the!?

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:57.360
What's going on?

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:04.070
The time has come to say goodbye.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:05.910
That is all.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:21.420
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:28.430
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:38.430
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:51.940
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.490 --> 00:23:06.490
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:20.740
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:31.150
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:40.570 --> 00:23:41.100
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.500
<i>The vicious battle has ended.</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:46.440
<i>After putting an end to a long battle,</i>

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:48.780
<i>it looks like Train has</i>
<i>taken a load off his mind.</i>

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:51.780
<i>Sven, too... and the others as well.</i>

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:55.780
<i>They're all happy that</i>
<i>the world will become peaceful.</i>

00:23:55.780 --> 00:24:01.390
<i>But I... feel as though</i>
<i>my heart is being squeezed tight.</i>

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:02.520
<i>Someone is... calling me...</i>

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:05.490
"Drowning Cat"
<i>Someone is... calling me...</i>
